<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady in slow market.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady in slow market.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were steady on Monday in quiet conditions, dealers said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   182-184		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     189-191		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		 165			nc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
